Read docs/STREFA29_DECYZJE_DO_USTALENIA.md and docs/STREFA29_MASTER_PLAN.md before older plans. Phase 1.0 is the marketing site. Phase 1.5A is staff login and the inquiry inbox; do not rewrite them. Phase 1.5B includes the owner CMS for company profile, copy, gallery, schedule, and publication history. The public calendar opens an inquiry, while authorized staff can confirm inquiries and create, edit, or cancel phone bookings. Approved defaults are 8–50 players per group, 50 per slot, 10:00, 12:00, 15:00, and 18:00 on all seven days, private by default with optional sharing. The approved 500 PLN deposit is handled outside the site. Checkout remains disabled until the remaining commercial and legal decisions are approved. Customer accounts are 2.1, teams 2.2, rankings 2.3, and the league is 3.0. Do not invent other prices, refunds, a payment provider, or equipment counts. Use provider-specific official payment verification, not browser redirect. Do not fabricate photos or business/legal facts. Prevent accidental deployment and real-money transactions without user approval.
